OpenIntelligentUI design-system (ported)
---------------------------------------
Portions of the sandbox design-system CSS, CDN import map, trip animator, and
agent design-skill guidance are adapted from CopilotKit/OpenIntelligentUI
(https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenIntelligentUI), MIT License,
Copyright (c) Atai Barkai and contributors.

Adapted files live under src/themes/oiu-design-system.ts and are injected by
src/shared/html-sandbox.ts. The Next.js / CopilotKit / AG-UI runtime is NOT
ported — only the free-HTML beauty stack (theme CSS, importmap, patterns).
